<title>SWEDEN: Astra says to build factory in China.</title>
<headline>Astra says to build factory in China.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pharmaceuticals group Astra AB on Thursday said that it planned to build a factory in China in the coming years.</p>
<p>It also planned to build another factory in Japan.</p>
<p>&quot;In the coming years we will build a new factory in Japan and one in China,&quot; Astra's managing director Hakan Mogren said at a seminar in Alvsjomassan near Stockholm on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Joel Dahlberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1011</p>
</text>
